The heyday of capital construction brought about by great leadership
Under the wise leadership of the great Party Central Committee, Pyongyang, the capital of our socialist homeland, is being transformed day by day, engraving the new image of the war on its headquarters, and our people are welcoming a historic day when the solemn struggle to build housing for 50,000 households in Pyongyang City began..
２０２１March 23, 2018
The groundbreaking ceremony for the construction of 10,000 residential units in Pyongyang City, held with the presence of respected Comrade Kim Jong-un, was a significant opportunity that marked another significant milestone in the history of capital construction..
The entire people of the country, who look back with boundless pride on the past five years in which unprecedented miracles have been created in the construction of the capital, driven by the dear Comrade General Secretary's undying love for the people, warmly embrace the world of undying devotion of a peerless man who devoted himself to the brilliant transformation of Pyongyang..
Dear Comrade Kim Jong-un said the following:.
《Our Pyongyang should be the most beautiful and greatest city in the world..》
Reflecting the will and desire of the people who want to live civilized in excellent houses, the respected Comrade General Secretary made the construction of houses for 50,000 households in Pyongyang a policy at the historic 8th Congress of the Party, and organized and led the grandiose construction campaigns that took place year after year, unfolding the heyday of capital construction..
At the 2nd Plenary Meeting of the 8th Central Committee of the Party, the construction of residential houses was considered an important project to provide a stable and civilized life to the people., The dear Comrade General Secretary, who raised the issue as a political issue to protect the authority of the Party Congress, personally attended the groundbreaking ceremony for the construction of 10,000 residential units in Pyongyang City on March 23, 2021. Through the construction of 50,000 residential units, we will not only change the face of the capital city once again, but also establish a new platform that will sublimate and develop socialist construction step by step with confidence. era of progress, He expressed confidence that an era of power would be ushered in..
The respected Comrade General Secretary said that the construction of residences in the capital is a long-awaited project that our Party and the country are pursuing as the most important task and a promise the Party and the government made to the people, adding that the entire capital construction area is a new high point of socialist construction., He wisely guided us to become the main offensive front symbolizing the turbulent times..
The respected Comrade General Secretary, who defined prioritizing the people's convenience as the core of urban construction, clearly specified the direction and methods for implementing the grand construction plan that will bring real and fundamental changes to the people's lives..
During the period from Songhwa Street to the construction of 10,000 residential homes in the fourth phase in the Hwaseong district, the respected Comrade General Secretary visited the site as many as 10 times and devoted his efforts and logos to ensure that our Party's people-first architectural philosophy was thoroughly implemented in each and every building..
In those turbulent days when modern new streets were being built every year in our capital, which boasts a long history, creating a wonderful reality, the number of design plans completed by the respected Comrade General Secretary himself numbered in the thousands..
deep night, House layout plan even in the early morning, Under the energetic leadership of the respected Comrade General Secretary, who looked at bird's-eye views, visited construction sites in person, and led us to constantly pioneer new frontiers in the development of socialist civilization in construction, a series of miraculous construction myths were created in the construction of houses for 50,000 households in Pyongyang..
Thanks to the dedicated struggle of the soldiers and builders who held the Party's noble meaning of devotion to the people deep in their hearts and stepped forward with unwavering will, the amount of foundation excavation and foundation concrete alone amounted to about 100,002 million each.㎥, ３Over 400,000 people㎥And the construction of a high-rise residential building, housing nearly 900 households, was completed in just 80 days..
In addition, it clearly demonstrates the power of the great unity of the people and the military, and in just one year, hundreds of thousands of people were built over the land area of 56 Jeongbo.㎡160 high-rise buildings with a total building area of, High-rise residences and public buildings, Songhwa Street, equipped with a service network, has emerged as the first entity to ensure the solid victory of the 5-year capital construction plan..
By constructing luxurious houses for ordinary workers in a historical and famous place in the capital, a complete fusion of buildings and nature while preserving the natural environment on the banks of the picturesque Potong River, supported by the sublime majesty of the great leader Comrade Kim Il-sung, who will continue the history of love for the people for generations to come., The construction of an attic housing complex that perfectly realizes the organic and scientific arrangement of living space and ecological space is an excellent standard for residential areas in our country., An example has been set.
The first phase of construction of 10,000 residential units in Hwaseong District added 2,000 more households than planned, creating hundreds of high-rise buildings on a large site of 1,500 units., High-rise residences and public buildings, volunteer network, It is a huge construction task that requires the construction of facilities, and is almost three times the amount of Songhwa Street construction a year ago..
The county and civilian builders upheld the Party Central Committee's intention to make the beacon of innovation in the construction sector burn fiercely as a great leap forward on all fronts of socialist construction, unleashed their strong fighting spirit and unyielding power of self-reliance, and completed the first phase of residential building construction in the Hwaseong district within one year, proudly displaying a scene of new houses unique to our country..
The joy and happiness of becoming the owner of a new home, As the streets of the capital were filled with the great pride and self-confidence of the people who enjoy the rare civilization they had envisioned in their ideals, the joyous sound of the second phase of construction of 10,000 homes in the Hwaseong District and the start of new street construction in the Seopo District in 2023 once again filled the world..
Successive attacks on construction command center for 50,000 households in Pyongyang City, Waving under the banner of continuous innovation, all construction workers worked hard to build the second phase of the Hwaseong district with extraordinary determination and maximum effort..
Our trustworthy youth vanguard, who cherished the great faith of the peerless man who entrusted the entire construction of the important object, which erected houses for over 400 generations to form a unique street at the northern gateway of the capital Pyongyang, to the Socialist Patriotic Youth League and the Baekdu Mountain Heroes Youth Shock Brigade, completed the massive earth handling and basic excavation tasks in a short period of time, and the young soldiers also completed the task. Height is about 220mThe frame work of an 80-story house was successfully completed as an exhibition for the Party's founding anniversary..
２０２４In 2018, the construction of 10,000 homes and avant-garde streets in the second phase of the Hwaseong district, which was expanded more than the first phase of construction, was successfully completed, clearly confirming the development potential of Juche Joseon, which is taking greater strides in advancing and creating socialist civilization at an astonishing pace that surpasses existing practices every year..
Under the scientific and energetic leadership of the great Party Central Committee, a modern high-rise building has achieved an ideal harmony through the excellent fusion of architectural and formative artistry and advanced civilization in the Hwaseong district., High-rise residential houses and unique commercial and welfare service bases with strong symbolism have sprung up majestically as a new large building group, marking the third completion..
３Stage 1: With the construction of 10,000 homes, the Hwaseong district becomes a single administrative district., economy, A center that can secure cultural functions and lead existing areas in the metropolitan area to civilization and enlightenment, It has revealed its perfect status as a model, and meaningful development has been achieved that creates a stark contrast between yesterday's Pyongyang, which has gone through decades of change, and today's modernized Pyongyang..
２０２６In February 2018, we witnessed the remarkable development of the Juche-driven and people-oriented character unique to our party and country and the people-first architecture., With the completion of the 10,000-unit residences and Saebyeol Street in the 4th stage, which splendidly stood up and united the struggle for the final stage of the monumental 5-year capital construction plan, the Hwaseong district was transformed into a modern administrative district and became a symbol of the new miracle of socialist Joseon, indomitable along with the great Kim Jong-un era., It shines even brighter as a pronoun.
Feeling proudly the development of the capital city that has been achieved during the past five years of struggle filled with dazzling changes, our people firmly hold the conviction that thanks to the presence of our dear Comrade General Secretary, the capital city of Pyongyang will be transformed even more brilliantly into a paradise of happiness where socialist civilization is in full bloom..
The people of the entire country and the soldiers of the People's Army are following the wise leadership of the great Party Central Committee and supporting the brilliant pace of advancement of Juche Joseon., A hundred times the pride and courage that created the struggle tradition, We will continue the period of great prosperity in construction by building up momentum and vigorously carrying out a general advance to realize the new vision goals presented by the Party's 9th Congress..
